DTSTART:20240215T000000
DTEND:20240215T020000
DTSTAMP:20260928T185823Z
UID:aacec44bfedf604e2ea988260c464e@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:The Bunker Hill Museum’s exhibits and dioramas tell the stor
 ies of the Battle of Bunker Hill\, the construction of the Monument\, and 
 the history of the Charlestown Neighborhood. The museum is housed in the o
 ld Charlestown branch of the Boston Public Library. Guests can request acc
 ess to the Bunker Hill Monument\, which offers one of the best views in th
 e city. Tour Availability: Daily Hours: 10 am - 4:30 pm\n\nSources: Meet B
 oston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/bunker-hill-museum/795
 11/
LOCATION:43 Monument Ave\, 43 Monument Ave\, Boston\, MA\, 02129
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/bunker-hill-museum/79511/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Museum of Bad Art
DTSTART:20240215T000000
DTEND:20240215T020000
DTSTAMP:20260928T185823Z
UID:74d4783e48ca710c2476f9d61bcb4d@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:MOBA is the world's only museum dedicated to the collection\, 
 exhibition\, and celebration of art that would not be welcomed to any trad
 itional art museum. Our collection includes sincere art in which something
  has gone wrong in a way that results in a compelling\, interesting image.
  Hours: Sunday / Monday 11:30am - 9pm Tuesday through Thursday 11:30am -10
 pm Friday / Saturday 11:30am - 11pm Admission: free\n\nSources: Meet Bosto
 n\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/museum-of-bad-art/79503/
