  TV5’s Chronicle\, our tour is voted the best Boston Chocolate Tour. Boo
 k today to reserve your spot. Located right outside of Boston in Cambridge
  on the Red Line MBTA train stop\, Harvard Square is home to Harvard Unive
 rsity and has a flourishing food scene with some of the most unique food i
