BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Exhibit: Discovering King Tut's Tomb
DTSTART:20260228T000000
DTEND:20261011T000000
DTSTAMP:20260928T185823Z
UID:cc5ece881bb56d0c9fc324c56f144f@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Walk through ancient chambers and uncover the secrets of Egypt
 's most iconic pharaoh. Experience the wonders of King Tut’s Tomb as it 
 was discovered over 100 years ago without leaving Boston. Take a spellbind
 ing tour of the tomb\, its treasures\, and ancient Egyptian civilization. 
 Through sets\, artifacts\, and multimedia installations\, be transported b
 ack in time and immersed in the sights and sounds of Howard Carter’s gre
 at discovery. Save 40% on Tickets To Celebrate the Opening Weekend\, MEET 
 BOSTON invites you to SAVE 40% OFF Regular priced tickets with code: MEETB
 OSTON To redeem your savings code\, tutboston.com and select the date and 
 entry time. Select the applicable ticket type and add desired number of ti
 ckets to the cart. Click continue to the cart/checkout screen and input th
 e savings code (MEETBOSTON) into voucher/gift voucher box. Your total disc
