DESCRIPTION:Each Supper begins with a special program featuring a presenta
 tion from an expert interpreter of the Shakers\, providing an opportunity 
 for you to learn more about the fascinating ways the Shakers lived and thr
 ived. Depending on the time of year\, the dinners may be held in the 1830 
 Brick Dwelling or outside with a view of the gardens. Inspired by authenti
 c Shaker recipes\, each communal meal features meat and produce from our f
 arm prepared by a local Berkshire chef. Shaker Supper – June 4 from 6-8 
 pm Shaker Supper – October 15 from 6-8 pm\n\nSources: The Berkshires\nEv
 ent page: https://berkshires.org/events-old/shaker-suppers-at-hsv/
