DESCRIPTION:Sound Baths are immersive experiences of deep relaxation for y
 our mind\, body\, and heart. The tones and vibrations of the sound bowls h
 elp calm our brains into Alpha and Theta waves\, which are associated with
  deep relaxation\, meditation\, intuition\, healing\, and enhanced creativ
 e thinking. They gently stimulate the Vagus Nerve\, bringing your body int
 o a state of “rest and repair\,” and giving you a deep sense of wellbe
 ing. Space is limited. Registration is required. Contact Ellen to schedule
  a special sound bath for your group\, at the studio or at your location. 
 Private\, one-on-one intuitive energy healing and support sessions with El
 len can be scheduled by appointment.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent p
 age: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/sound-bath-in-woods-hole/51905/
