DESCRIPTION:Join the murder mystery experience that puts YOU in the spotli
 ght in Boston’s Gaming District. This comedic dinner theater show at Exc
 hange Street Bistro is the killer game everyone’s dying to play. Don’t
  let this unforgettable event pass you by! At this event like no other\, y
 ou’ll play along as a detective or play a part as a suspect in the crime
 . Work with other guests to crack the case over a mouthwatering three-cour
 se meal\, and discover whodunnit before the killer gets away! Mingle and c
 onnect with other teams and intriguing suspects\, discover clues\, uncover
  shocking secrets\, and unleash your inner child’s imagination during th
 is interactive comedic experience. But watch out! The killer could be anyo
 ne… even YOU! Participate in a new mystery every month! From the glitz o
 f 1930s Hollywood in “Best Laid Plans” to the roaring 1920s with “De
 ath of a Gangster\,” each event offers unforgettable thrills. Boogie at 
 a 1950s sock hop\, solve a 90s crime in “Good Riddance\,” or celebrate
  the season with “The Most Wonderful Crime of the Year.” Whether it's 
 a billionaire’s masquerade\, a 1980s bash\, or a chilling wedding-themed
  whodunit\, there’s a unique mystery waiting for you. Mark your calendar
  and join the fun at Exchange Street Bistro in Boston! LEARN MORE / GET TI
 CKETS\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/even
 t/murder-mystery-co-dinner-theater-show/90359/
