 er\, The Norwegians is a sharp\, surprising dark comedy about love gone wr
 ong—and the lengths we go to set things right. Betty and Olive\, two wom
 en reeling from romantic betrayal\, hatch an unlikely plan: hiring a pair 
 of Norwegian hitmen to deal with the men who wronged them.\n\nSources: The
  Berkshires\nEvent page: https://berkshires.org/events-old/the-norwegians/
