 litter collected from Worcester’s Elm Park\, photographs exploring Weste
 rn\, African\, and Afro-Descendant portraiture\, visual and performance ar
 t in collaboration with vultures\, and much more. Material Needs 2026 feat
 ures the following artists: Ben Cline Jennifer Davis Carey Kristi DiSalle 
 Claudio Eshun Kate Egnaczak Anne Harris Sheila Papetti ArtsWorcester // 44
  Portland Street\, Worcester MA On view September 9 - October 25\, 2026 Ga
 llery hours run WED - SUN\, each day from 12pm - 5pm\, and are always open
  and free to all. Parking is available at the Worcester Public Library (Mc
 Grath) Lot\, Federal Plaza Garage\, Worcester Common Garage\, and Pearl-El
 m Garage. Metered street parking is also available. On weekends\, and on w
 eekdays after 5:00 PM\, visitors may park in the Printers Building parking
