 rom large-format prints\, 52" x 30" x 20"\, 2026\n\nSources: Discover Cent
 ral Massachusetts\nEvent page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/ope
 n-gallery-hours%3a-material-needs-2026/30644/
LOCATION:ArtsWorcester\, 44 Portland St.\, Worcester\, MA\, 01608
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/open-gallery-hours%3a-material
 -needs-2026/30644/
