DESCRIPTION:The Fish and Farm market returns to the historic Boston Fish P
 ier! Every Saturday from through October 31\, the market will transform th
 e heart of the South Boston Waterfront into a lively hub for fresh\, local
 \, and sustainable food. Set at the bustling intersection of Seaport Boule
 vard and D Street\, it will be more than just a place to shop—it will be
  a community gathering space where visitors can explore Boston’s best se
 afood purveyors alongside a vibrant mix of farm-fresh produce\, meats\, ch
 eeses\, breads\, and specialty products. With support from Massport and a 
 growing lineup of dedicated vendors\, the market will connect shoppers wit
 h high-quality\, local food options in an inclusive\, welcoming environmen
 t all season long. Fish & Farm Market Vendors Accept: Cash / Cards / Mobil
 e Payment EBT Cards (SNAP) Senior and WIC Coupons Boston Farmers Market Co
