 ptember 27th 2026\, 2:00 pm October 1st 2026\, 7:00 pm October 2nd 2026\, 
 7:00 pm October 3rd 2026\, 2:00 pm October 3rd 2026\, 7:00 pm October 4th 
 2026\, 2:00 pm October 8th 2026\, 7:00 pm October 9th 2026\, 7:00 pm Octob
 er 10th 2026\, 2:00 pm October 11th 2026\, 2:00 pm Close While violent feu
 ds run rampant and danger lurks around every corner\, two young lovers mee
 t\, and with a visceral attraction are immediately drawn together. The hop
 e of their future is ransacked by the reality of their warring families. W
 ill their love cause more death? Or will they inspire Verona to live\, and
  to love?\n\nSources: Discover Central Massachusetts\nEvent page: https://
 www.discovercentralma.org/event/tht-rep-presents-romeo-%26-juliet/30669/
