SUMMARY:Silent Book Club & Write Night
DTSTART:20260928T000000
DTEND:20260928T020000
DTSTAMP:20260928T185823Z
UID:cd5314cbc6a40dfca336dd6bcd8f8d@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Always wishing you had more time to read? Or finish that novel
 /short story/poem you've been working on? Trying to meet more bookish folk
 s? Then Silent Book Club & Write Night is perfect for you! Treat yourself 
 biweekly to a night of reading\, writing and friendship. It's a great way 
 to practice self-care during the week\, meet new people\, and find great b
 ook recommendations. The book is not assigned\; just bring the one you are
  currently reading and dive in! Bring whatever you're currently writing or
  start something brand new! At the beginning of each meeting\, there will 
 be a 30 minute period to order food/drinks and mingle\, followed by an hou
 r of silent reading and writing. We conclude with a half hour of discussin
 g our current books and writing projects and then we wrap-up. We look forw
 ard to meeting our fellow book lovers! Come solo or bring a friend! Either
  way\, our full menu of dinner\, drinks\, and snacks will be available for
  you to nosh throughout the night! LEARN MORE\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEve
 nt page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/silent-book-club-%26-write-night
 /93408/
LOCATION:Trident Booksellers & Cafe\, Trident Booksellers & Cafe 338 Newbu
 ry Street\, Boston\, MA\, 02115
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/silent-book-club-%26-write-night/9340
 8/
