 ng\, has ruled the ratings in the Boston market since he first arrived at 
 KISS 108! Matty's unique interview style and insightful yet sarcastic comm
 entary has allowed him the good fortune of winning the coveted National As
 sociation of Broadcasters Marconi Award for Personality of the Year\, not 
 once\, but twice. The Matty Shows signature segment is the wildly popular 
 Right Now\, where Matty takes live callers and helps listeners with whatev
 er is going on in their lives! In addition to his national awards\, Matty 
 has been inducted into the Massachusetts Radio Hall of Fame. When he is no
 t on the air making New Englanders laugh during their brutal morning commu
 te\, Matty spends a great deal of his free time on the golf course attempt
