DESCRIPTION:The Jersey Girls Join us Wednesday\, September 30 at 6 p.m. fo
 r a multi-author event on craft\, courage\, and creative freedom with The 
 Jersey Girls. This evening will bring together three unique and powerful w
 omen. Join them at the West Falmouth Library to learn more about how writi
 ng is who they are – it’s not just what they do. Featured authors are 
 Sandra Barone\, The Dark Fiction & Murder Mystery Writer\; Christine Giuli
 ano\, The Poet\; and Pamela Martorama\, The Anthology Writer & Curator Thi
 s event will include a Q&A\, book sale and signing. Free and open to all. 
 They will dive into conversation about the creative courage it has taken t
 hem\, about the messy\, magical\, deeply human process of creating somethi
 ng from nothing\, at any age\, at any stage of life. Register Here\n\nSour
