 es\, and proceeds from the cash bar will go to Transhealth. Lovestruck Bar
  & Cafe will match additional donations made at the event up to $5\,000. W
 e appreciate your support and look forward to celebrating with you! Mix\, 
 mingle\, and shop a curated selection of LGBTQIA+ reads or purchase books 
 to be donated to trans youth groups and family support circles. Come raise
  a glass\, find a good book\, meet your community\, and help make sure tra
 ns people\, especially trans youth\, can continue to get the care they nee
