SUMMARY:Britt Connors Band
DTSTART:20261001T000000
DTEND:20261001T000000
DTSTAMP:20260928T185823Z
UID:00e077ec47344c0ad95c452d5e6c18@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Expect a set that slips easily between soulful ballads\, pop-r
 ock\, and gospel-infused Americana\, the kind of range that comes from a c
 hildhood spent absorbing folk\, jazz\, classical\, and 80s and 90s pop all
  at once. Connors built her career right here\, moving to Somerville after
  college to learn guitar and find her footing in the Boston scene\, and th
 at homegrown history shows in every note. Her longtime drummer and husband
  Mike Connors anchors the rhythm section\, a partnership that's held stead
 y onstage since 2008. The set draws from four albums deep\, including her 
 latest EP Exhale\, six songs that carry echoes of Bonnie Raitt\, Aimee Man
 n\, and Ray LaMontagne. She brings a stacked band of Boston mainstays for 
 the night\, guitar\, bass\, cello\, keys\, and a horn section led by trump
 eter Jerry Sabatini\, the same lineup that filled out every track on the r
 ecord. Live\, that fuller sound turns intimate songwriting into something 
 with real lift. It's a hometown show in every sense\, seated close with a 
 glass of wine in hand\, the kind of night built for an artist who's spent 
 years earning her place in this city's music scene. LEARN MORE / GET TICKE
 TS\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/b
 ritt-connors-band/93096/
LOCATION:City Winery Boston\, City Winery 80 Beverly Street\, Boston\, MA
 \, 02114
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/britt-connors-band/93096/
END:VEVENT
