 music and contemporary sounds. With chart-topping hits across South Asian 
 cinema and international stages\, his performances are a transcendent cele
 bration of love\, spirituality\, and unity. Audiences in Boston can expect
  an unforgettable evening of timeless melodies and heartfelt expression\n
