DESCRIPTION:Boston\, get ready—Smashing Pumpkins are taking over TD Gard
 en for a night that feels like a hometown tradition for live music lovers.
  Smashing Pumpkins - Boston Boston lands in Massachusetts with the kind of
  energy that turns a regular Friday into a citywide event. Expect a set th
 at leans into their signature contrasts: shimmering melodies\, jagged riff
 s\, and Billy Corgan’s unmistakable voice cutting through the roar. It
 ’s the rare show where arena-scale power still feels personal. TD Garden
  delivers the full experience—easy to reach\, surrounded by downtown buz
 z\, and built for big sound and bigger singalongs. Smashing Pumpkins - Bos
 ton TD Garden is made for fans who want to feel every note. Grab your tick
 ets\, rally your crew\, and make Oct 2\, 2026 a night you’ll be talking 
 about long after the lights go down.\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: 
 https://www.meetboston.com/event/smashing-pumpkins/90697/
