DESCRIPTION:Enjoy the beautiful sunset on Boston Harbor and help raise fun
 ds for a summer of free Boston beach events for all. Funds from your ticke
 t will go directly towards Save the Harbor's Better Beaches Grant Program
 \, which awards small grants to local organizations and artists to activat
 e the region’s public beaches through free events and programs on DCR be
 aches in Nahant\, Lynn\, Revere\, Winthrop\, East Boston\, South Boston\, 
 Dorchester\, Quincy\, and Hull. Save the Harbor brings FREE community even
 ts to Boston Harbor beaches all summer long! If you enjoyed a summer of fr
 ee fun with us\, consider pouring back into our programs by joining this c
 ruise. Your support will help us continue bringing inclusive and community
  programming to the waterfront. On the cruise you can expect stunning Bost
 on harbor views and the signature Save The Harbor fun we bring to all our 
 work! Cash bar on board. LEARN MORE / GET TICKETS\n\nSources: Meet Boston
