 rom peaceful meditation to higher thoughts before finally arriving at a so
 rt of spiritual enlightenment. RSVP Below: https://lp.constantcontactpages
 .com/ev/reg/w48hpeb About the Exhibition: The Guild of Boston Artists is p
 roud to present Painting the Profound\, a spotlight exhibition of painting
 s by Erik Koeppel at its Newbury Street Gallery from October 3 - October 2
 4. The show will feature 20 of the New Hampshire artist's signature Hudson
  River School landscapes\, each depicting a journey towards a higher ideal
  of beauty in nature. LEARN MORE\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: http
