 ue aesthetic approach shines through in her sporadic ‘make-due’ energy
  that flows seamlessly between 2D and 3D forms. The resulting works are im
 mersive and modular series and installations that read as both specific an
 d universalizing\, personal and relatable.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEv
