DTSTAMP:20260928T185823Z
UID:0e45aa310884545b76d2e9f4346889@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Internationally acclaimed Greek superstar Konstantinos Argiros
  brings his signature blend of contemporary pop and modern laïko music to
  Agganis Arena on October 3. Widely regarded as one of Greece’s most suc
 cessful and influential recording artists\, Argiros has captivated audienc
 es around the world with his powerful vocals\, chart-topping hits\, and el
 ectrifying live performances. Following a series of sold-out international
  arena shows and record-breaking appearances across Europe and North Ameri
 ca\, he continues to unite Greek communities worldwide through music that 
 celebrates passion\, culture\, and connection. Fans can expect an unforget
 table evening featuring his biggest hits\, stunning production\, and the e
 nergy that has made him a global phenomenon. *Please note all lineups are 
 subject to change. LEARN MORE / GET TICKETS\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent
  page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/konstantinos-argiros/93388/
