DTSTAMP:20260928T185823Z
UID:6c20e15fafb737bf885cab2cb54436@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us on October 3\, 2026\, for a day of hands-on exploratio
 n! Scouts will discover how children of the 1830s used skills that Scouts 
 still practice today—from teamwork and problem-solving to outdoor skills
 \, making\, exploring\, and helping others. Enjoy special drop-in activiti
 es\, included with admission\, such as historic games\, block printing\, a
 nd scarecrow making\, or sign up for hands-on workshops! On Scout Day\, Ol
 d Sturbridge Village offers a special rate on general daytime admission fo
 r participating scouts and families: $12 Youth / $17 Adult.\n\nSources: Di
 scover Central Massachusetts\nEvent page: https://www.discovercentralma.or
 g/event/scout-day/30903/
