SUMMARY:Giocosa Chamber Music presents Nevermore
DTSTART:20261004T000000
DTEND:20261004T000000
DTSTAMP:20260928T185823Z
UID:52f9e125b934c24552a3ebdaeaa9bd@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:We're kicking off the season on the dark(er) side. A little my
 sterious music\, a little Edgar Allan Poe\, an innocent maiden visited by 
 the specter of death...you know...just a normal weekend. Giocosa Chamber M
 usic’s first concert of the season features string quartets by Cecilia M
 uylaert\, Evan Blaché\, Shostakovich and Beethoven in a unique presentati
 on of Poe’s The Raven\, plus Franz Schubert’s iconic Death and the Mai
 den. A classical concert gets no spookier.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nE
 vent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/giocosa-chamber-music-pres
 ents-nevermore/52346/
