BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Garden Tours at the Museums on the Green
DTSTART:20261006T000000
DTEND:20261006T000000
DTSTAMP:20260928T185823Z
UID:abac05b31f19b5cb58c93dc427e329@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:The Falmouth Historical Society and the Falmouth Garden Club a
 re pleased to provide the opportunity to tour the spectacular gardens at t
 he Museums on the Green this summer! Take a walking tour of each of the fi
 ve gardens in this beautiful location led by Falmouth Garden Club members.
  Tours on Tuesday or Saturday at 11am\, allowing time to visit the buildin
 gs. The tour will last about 40 minutes. The dates are as follows: Tuesday
 \, October 6th Saturday\, October 10th Tours meet at the Hallet Barn Visit
 ors Center. Donations for the upkeep of the gardens would be greatly appre
 ciated! Join us for this delightful new program and learn about the garden
 s at the Falmouth Historical Society\, Museums on the Green! Please regist
 er in advance. Free\, $5 donation pp is suggested. Please Register Here\n
 \nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/ev
 ent/garden-tours-at-the-museums-on-the-green/52281/
LOCATION:Falmouth Museums on the Green\, 55 & 65 Palmer Avenue\, Falmouth
 \, MA\, 02540
URL:https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/garden-tours-at-the-museums-on-th
 e-green/52281/
