BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Haunted Hallows at Mashpee Commons
DTSTART:20261009T000000
DTEND:20261031T000000
DTSTAMP:20260928T185823Z
UID:95ffc8651422542480c590df868a02@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:For generations\, the Lord of Morrisey Manor kept to his own h
 alls. This October\, he escaped\, and he has taken up residence in the Hau
 nted Hallows at Mashpee Commons! Come if you dare! Haunted Hallows is a 30
 -minute immersive Halloween experience built on one simple idea: you contr
 ol the fear. When you arrive\, you choose your scare level. Dial it down t
 o a little boo. Dial it up to extreme shock. Same haunt\, same story\, sam
 e Lord but the night is yours to set. That means the whole family can walk
  in together and everyone gets exactly the night they came for. Open every
  Friday and Saturday October 9-31. Buy tickets now! From 6:15 PM: Early Re
 leases The first releases of the night\, while there's still light in the 
 sky. Physically gentler and suitable for kids of all ages: no total darkne
 ss\, no chase\, no contact. You get the story\, the sets\, and a very thea
 trical Lord and his very odd household. Through the 8:45 PM release: After
  Dark Once the light goes\, the Hallows change. Groups are still released 
 one at a time at your booked time\, so you go through with your own people
  and never stand in a line\, but this is where the full haunt lives. Later
  releases are limited and do sell out. Before you face the Lord\, come wan
 der Halloweentown\, set up right at the Mashpee Farmers Market and free to
  walk through. No Hallows ticket required. Opens 5:00 PM at the Farmers Ma
 rket on the Village Green at Mashpee Commons. Brought to you by the Mashpe
 e Chamber of Commerce to support the Mashpee Improvement Fund.\n\nSources:
  Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/haunte
 d-hallows-at-mashpee-commons/52435/
LOCATION:Mashpee Commons\, 4 Job's Fishing Road\, Mashpee\, MA\, 02649
URL:https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/haunted-hallows-at-mashpee-common
 s/52435/
END:VEVENT
