SUMMARY:Celebrate Living with Art
DTSTART:20261010T000000
DTEND:20261010T000000
DTSTAMP:20260928T185823Z
UID:46fdfb92cbd9e6f601af66f997f6eb@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:A new exhibition honoring The Lily House. The public is invite
 d to join us to meet Lily House staff members and volunteers and learn abo
 ut the services they offer. Some of Cape Cod’s most sought-after artists
  will be on hand to discuss their latest works and to explain their techni
 ques and inspirations. Addison Art Gallery will also show abstract work by
  guest artist Denise Dunlap. Live music by Larry Murray\, nibbles and liba
 tions. The Lily House provides residents with around-the-clock compassiona
 te and holistic care—including physical\, emotional\, social\, and spiri
 tual support—in a beautiful and peaceful home.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Cham
 ber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/celebrate-living-wit
 h-art/52530/
