 \, children will learn that even small acts of kindness can make a big dif
 ference for the environment. Come listen\, learn\, and celebrate our wonde
 rful world together!\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www
 .capecodchamber.org/event/children%e2%80%99s-story-time-featuring-author-b
 arbara-feltquate-%e2%80%9cbe-kind-to-the-environment%e2%80%9d/52475/
