UID:a87ca50d2ff2911e43a2ed11dad677@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Indigenous People's Day! Join Wampanoag/Nipmuc\, Wab
 an Webquish\, and local historian\, Bob Kelley\, on this walk around the b
 oundaries of this one-time reservation to learn more about those that once
  lived here. This special annual walk starts at Packet Landing\, continues
  to the Indian Memorial\, and will finish back at the Yarmouth Quaker Meet
 inghouse. Tour participants are invited to break bread with the Friends in
  the Ancient Schoolhouse on the Quaker grounds\, where a full Indigenous s
 tyle meal is included.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://w
