BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sins\, Sips\, and Secrets
DTSTART:20261015T000000
DTEND:20261029T000000
DTSTAMP:20260928T185823Z
UID:c37692a4e0093c9b7c285212fa13ac@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:This October we invite you to join us for a night at the Museu
 m. On an interactive tour\, participants will visit the 1790 Dr. Francis W
 icks House to hear a different story in each room of Falmouth’s nefariou
 s and unearthly past. Using first person accounts\, diaries\, and newspape
 r records\, you will hear things about the actual fears about the night\, 
 wayward travelers\, and spirits in times past. During the event\, drinks a
 nd appetizers will be available from 5:30pm\, come enjoy libations before 
 or after your tour and stroll our grounds\, which will be lit by candlelig
 ht for the event. This is not a drop in event. Tour time is 6pm\, you’re
  welcome to come before your tour time to enjoy a drink and please arrive 
 in time for the tour. Meet at the Cultural Center first to check-in before
  the tour. $35 Museums on the Green Member/ $40 Non-member. Includes libat
 ions. Limited capacity. Max 15 people per tour. Register Here\n\nSources: 
 Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/sins-si
 ps-and-secrets/52488/
LOCATION:Falmouth Museums on the Green\, 55 & 65 Palmer Avenue\, Falmouth
 \, MA\, 02540
