DESCRIPTION:Our Next Murder Mystery Dinner Party is Coming! Join us Friday
 \, October 16th from 5:30pm to 8:30pm under our beautiful Sperry Tent for 
 MIDNIGHT AT THE MASQUERADE — an unforgettable evening of mystery\, intri
 gue\, and murder! Someone has been “murdered” at the Billionaires' Clu
 b Annual Masquerade Ball… and it’s up to YOU to help solve the crime! 
 The brilliant actors from Murder Mystery Co. will bring the mystery to lif
 e while you become part of the show. Work with your table\, trade clues\, 
 uncover secrets\, and see if you can figure out whodunit! A 3-course meal 
 will be served and is included in the ticket price. Starter\, Choice of 1 
 of 3 entree offerings\, and dessert. This is an interactive evening where 
 you’re both the diner AND the detective! Dressing up is encouraged! Thin
 k evening wear\, ball gowns\, suits\, tuxes\, and of course… masquerade 
 masks!\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchambe
