BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Alfred Hitchcock's Psycho in Concert
DTSTART:20261017T000000
DTEND:20261018T000000
DTSTAMP:20260928T185823Z
UID:8cf8f2b993384d1391ffcd2ea70182@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Date: October 17 & 18\, 2026 Showtimes: Sat 7:30 PM\, Sun 3:00
  PM Featured Artist: Alyssa Wang\, Conductor Location: Barnstable Performi
 ng Arts Center 744 West Main Street\, Hyannis Bernard Herrmann’s music f
 or Psycho is among the greatest film scores of all time. Come hear it perf
 ormed live\, perfectly synchronized to the film projected on the big scree
 n behind the Orchestra. Slashing strings\, pulsing rhythms\, and stark sil
 ences heighten every frame as music drives the tension in this classic thr
