DESCRIPTION:A little piece of the coast\, framed your way. The holidays ar
 e on the horizon\, and it’s the perfect time to gather\, create\, and br
 ing a little seaside inspiration home. Join Cape Cod native Mary Kate DeRo
 sa\, founder of Sea Linen of Cape Cod\, for a hands-on afternoon of coasta
 l creativity. Build your own one-of-a-kind shadow box using an assortment 
 of shells\, sea glass\, and seaside treasures. Create a festive holiday sh
 ape\, a miniature coastal scene\, or simply follow your imagination. No tw
 o shadow boxes will be alike\, and every creation will hold a little piece
  of the Cape. Workshop Includes: One 8" x 8" framed shadow box An assortme
 nt of mini shells\, sea glass\, and coastal treasures Glue and all tools n
 eeded to create your design Expert instruction from Mary Kate DeRosa Come 
 ready to create\, connect\, and make something uniquely your own. Open to 
 the public\, members\, and resort guests!\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEv
 ent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/decoupage-workshop%3a-shell
 s-%26-shadow-boxes/52464/
