DTSTART:20261018T000000
DTEND:20261018T000000
DTSTAMP:20260928T185823Z
UID:795df07aa9429fdd9b7c8620447050@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:A one-day on-camera intensive at FCTV. Join casting profession
 als Carolyn Pickman\, CSA\, and Katie O'Connor for a hands-on introduction
  to acting and auditioning for film\, television and commercials. Students
  will be given materials to prepare before class and will begin working on
 -camera. Parents: Join us for the final hour to review the takes and parti
 cipate in a Q & A. covering "the business" Ages 14-18 Beginners are welcom
 e! Learn more FCTV.org\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://w
 ww.capecodchamber.org/event/action!-at-fctv/52439/
LOCATION:Falmouth Community Media Center\, 310 Dillingham Avenue\, Falmout
 h\, MA\, 02540
