 ge of your seat from start to finish with heart-pumping music\, chiseled b
 odies\, seductive dance routines\, cheeky humor\, and that irresistible bo
 y-next-door charm that makes hearts melt! This isn’t a show you just sit
  and watch — MAGIC HUNKS® is a fully interactive experience that THUNDE
 RS with excitement. So come get a little rambunctious and wild in an empow
 ering\, fun-filled atmosphere designed just for YOU!\n\nSources: North of 
