DTEND:20261022T000000
DTSTAMP:20260928T185823Z
UID:fa2bad38c1300343c7a0c4fedec628@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:The Last Flight VIP Reception\, Book Signing and Book Talk | T
 hursday\, October 22. Meet the authors of The Last Flight and learn firsth
 and about the exhaustive\, emotional search for JFK\, Jr. The VIP Receptio
 n & Book Signing is 4:30 PM - 5:30 PM @ Nobska Lighthouse\, 233 Nobska Roa
 d\, Woods Hole\, MA. The Book Talk is 6 PM - 7 PM @ Church of the Messiah
 \, 16 Church Street\, Woods Hole\, MA. Tickets $30 for book talk only\, $5
 0 for VIP reception\, book signing and book talk. Advanced ticket purchase
  is required. Books will be available for purchase on the day of the event
 . All proceeds to benefit the Friends of Nobska Light. More information an
 d tickets HERE.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.cape
 codchamber.org/event/the-last-flight-vip-reception-book-signing-and-book-t
 alk/52384/
