DTEND:20261030T230000
DTSTAMP:20260928T185823Z
UID:e23718a60a840d7002c11c36899433@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Costumes encouraged! SAFETY is not your average 80’s band wi
 th 4 lead vocalists! Classic hits by Madonna • Prince • Cyndi Lauper 
 • Devo • Talking Heads • Soft Cell • Janet Jackson • Culture Clu
 b • Human League • George Michael • The Cure • Depeche Mode • Jo
 an Jett • Stevie Nicks • Eurythmics • Kim Wilde • Chaka Khan • P
 retenders • The Cars • David Bowie • Billy Idol • The Go-Go’s 
 • Pat Benatar and more!\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https:/
 /northofboston.org/event/safety-80s-21-halloween-show-the-late-show/
LOCATION:The Cut\, 177 Main Street\, Gloucester\, MA\, 01930
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/safety-80s-21-halloween-show-the-late-
 show/
