DTSTART:20261114T100000
DTEND:20261114T170000
DTSTAMP:20260928T185823Z
UID:0bf423174d9946f0aded13bf172fff@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the second Saturday of each month\, when the Cape 
 Ann Museum is free for all Cape Ann residents. Visitors of all ages are in
 vited to visit the CAM Education Studio to enjoy a new hands-on art projec
 t each month\, then grab a Cassie Scavenger Hunt and explore the galleries
 .\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event
 /family-programs-second-saturdays/2026-11-14/
LOCATION:Cape Ann Museum\, 27 Pleasant Street\, Gloucester\, 01930
